        "i1": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "<svg class=\"leaf-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#B89968\" opacity=\"0.3\"></circle><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#B89968\"></circle><g stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"54\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"54\" y2=\"30\"></line><line x1=\"13\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"17\"></line><line x1=\"43\" y1=\"43\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"47\"></line><line x1=\"13\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"43\"></line><line x1=\"43\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"13\"></line></g></svg>",
            "label": "The sunshine vitamin",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "Vitamin D3",
            "source": "Cholecalciferol · 5000 IU",
            "body": "<p>For most of human history, this was free. Sun on skin, D3 made. Then work became an inside job — offices, commutes, fluorescent light — and we quietly cut ourselves off.</p><p>D3 supports your immune system, your mood, your bones, your hormones, and the energy you have at 4pm. Most adults are short on it. Most don't know.</p>",
            "nick": "The one your office light can't replace."
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "<svg class=\"leaf-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M15 45 Q30 20 45 45 Q45 50 30 45 Q15 50 15 45 Z\" fill=\"#006E73\" opacity=\"0.35\"></path><path d=\"M15 45 Q30 20 45 45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#006E73\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#006E73\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></line><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#006E73\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></line><line x1=\"38\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"38\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#006E73\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></line></svg>",
            "label": "From natto fermentation",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "Vitamin K2",
            "source": "As menaquinone-7 (MK-7) · 90 mcg",
            "body": "<p>The traffic cop for calcium. Without K2, calcium piles up in arteries — exactly where you don't want it. With it, calcium goes where it's supposed to: bones, teeth, the structural body.</p><p>MK-7 is the most bioavailable form. We use it. Most cheaper multis don't.</p>",
            "nick": "The one nobody told you about."
          }
        }
